# Backend

- `controller` calls `StoryService` only. It does not touch repositories. ArchUnit fails the other way.
- Fetch failure is stored on the article. It does not abort `StoryService.create`.
- Bias is the outlet's. Untracked domains stay out of the percentage base.
- `news-rater.flags.image-backfill` and `news-rater.flags.open-api-ui` gate startup refetch and Swagger. Canary uses `application-canary.properties` and its own H2 file.
- Constructor injection. No field `@Autowired`.
